<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1VAKOLINDO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluva ndongola ya Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluva ndongola ya Mutumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">VAKOLINDO</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Tun'wona kuta, musula ya 1:1 baluva yino ya Vakolindo va kwantsa yandikwe na mutumi Pawulo. Yinlonjeka kuta yandikwe luvala kota lwa miyaka hamusini na jihanu hino hoavaga kuleleka Yesu. Yino yo baluva ndongola hagati ha tsila tsivili tso andiche Pawulo mutumi kwa chikundi cha vanya litimbilo lya Chilisito va muji gwa Kolindo. Yifuluche yive baluva yino andiche luvala lula ho ikalaga ku Efweso ho ang'acha kubita ku Kolindo ho akuva am'bita na kuwuya ku lujendo lwa ku Machedoniya musula ya 16:5-9.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluva yino yo majibu ga Pawulo kwa ndongwa tso aliapasile kuhuma kwa vanyalitumbilo vatunga va chikundi icho, kwa ndongwa tso tsidisilwe mu chikundi icho. Kaha vapunganaga na vavaga van'dita waafu. Vanu va muji gwa Kolindo gwavaga gun'tselanika ndalahela kwa ndongwa tsa waafu, kwasawuli iyo vanya litumbilo nawo vakasumwanaje kwasawuli ya ndongwa itso. Kaha baluva yino yina sula yimwe yoyinkweletsela ndongwa tsa wugano, nayo yo sula ya kumi na kadatu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fyofili mu baluva yino</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ankwantsa kwa kuvanguvasamusa Vakolindo na kumulumba Mulungu kwasawuli yawo. Musula ya 1:1-9.</para>
  <para style="io">Ankwanuchila taalifwa tsa ndongwa ntsibi na ankwantsa kutsisugulichila mu chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito yo vali ku Kolindo. Musula ya 1:10-4:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Kahi ankwantsa kulamula ndongwa tsa waafu na kisindika vene kwa vene mu kaye tsa wuhigo. Musula ya 5-6.</para>
  <para style="io">Akweletsela ndongwa tsa kitola, kutawula sadaka kwa misanamu, hila fyo van'ganika vave hala ho van'sala, fifunje fya Muhe va Mulungu, na ndongwa tsa wutsilipuko. Musula ya 7-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ansinda kwa kulonga ndongwa katsi, na mipanjo jake mwene. Mu sula ya 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Heni Pawulo, yo ntsachemilwe kwa wugano wa Mulungu ntsive mutumi va Chilisito Yesu, ntsili hano hamwe na mung'olotsetu Sositene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Ntsinguvandichila henye wo mumutumbye Mulungu wo mungikala ku Kolindo, henye wo mudisilwe muve vanu va Mulungu kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, wo mwachemilwe muve vahagulwa vake kota fyovali vanu veka wo vangumufugamila Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito, yo Mutwa vawo na vahetwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Ntsinguvasuchila kwa Mulungu Dada vetu, na kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito avapele wuwuya na wusichimafu.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angumulumba Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Ntsingumulumba Mulungu siku tseka kwajili yenyu kwasawuli avapelye henye wuwuya wake kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kwakuva kwa kula kihantsa kwenyu na Chilisito simwalagaya chinu chochive, nayo avagavye nyala tseka na wuvetso weka wa kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Mbikulo tsila tso tunvikula kwajili ya Chilisito tsa wukweli. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Ihyo simwagayile chinu chochive, hala ho munkuva mu n'tsindila kutsa kwake Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Mwene yo akuvakangatsa henye mbaka hawudugo, ili muleche kuva na wubi wowuve mbaka siku yila ya kutsa kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Mulungu yo vakihuvilwa, mwene yo avachemile henye muve na wumwe na Mwanage, Yesu Chilisito, Mutwa vetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugavika kwa vanu vanya litumbilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Vang'olotsangu ntsinguvagongola kwa wuvetso wa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito, kuta mupatanaje henye nyeka kwa chila chinu cho munlonga, mulekaje kutelana henye kwa henye. Mwelewanaje kwa chila chinu cho mun'gana kuchidita. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Vang'olotsangu ndongwa tso nyuliche kuhuma kwa vanu vatunga va mukaye ya Kulove, tsin'lajila kuta hagati henyu hana vanu vampungana. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ntsin'gana ndonje kuta, chila munu hagati henyu anlonga lulongwa lwake. Yumwe anlonga kuta, “Heni tsingumudichila Pawulo,” na yunji anlonga, “Heni tsingumudichila Apolo,” na yunji anlonga, “Heni tsingumudichila Chefwa,” na yunji anlonga, “Heni tsingumudichila Chilisito.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Mbe, Chilisito agaviche mu fikundi fikundi? Mbe Pawulo yo avambitwe mu musalaba kwasawuli yenyu? Awu mbe, mwabatitswe ili muve vadahitswa va Pawulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ntsingumulumba Mulungu kuta sitsamubatitse munu yoyuve hagati henyu, ila ntsavabatitse Chilisipo na Gayo ng'ani. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Ihyo lelo kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche alonje kuta abatitswe ili ave mudahitswa vangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Eena! Ntsiwuche kuta vanu vanji wo ntsavabatitse wo vala va mukaye ya Sitefwana. Lechelelo kulutila iwo sinambentsiwuche kuta ntsamubatitse munu yunji yoyuve. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Chilisito sianumile kubatitsa, ila anumile kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu, ila sintsavikwe kwa kihuvila nyala tsa vanu, ndisile ihyo ili wuvetso wa chifo cha Chilisito mu musalaba wuleche kubedalwa.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilisito yo wuvetso na ntselo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kwakuva wujumbe wa chifo cha Chilisito mu musalaba, kwa vala wo van'yaga van'wona kota lulongwa lwa wupufi hela. Lechelelo kwa hetwe wo tunkuluswa tun'wona kuta wo wuvetso wa Mulungu wa kutukulusa hetwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Ngwananga ntselo tsawo vanya ntselo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na kutsidita nyala tsa vala vanya nyala kuva siyo chinu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Ihyo alikwiya munya ntselo? Alikwiya munu yo agatsele malajitso ga Musa? Kaha alikwiya mulontsi munofu va ndongwa tsa mu inyi va siku tsino? Mbe, Mulungu si akadisile ntselo tsa mu inyi yino kuva wupufi?<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Mulungu yo munya ntselo, na vanu sivafuluche vamutsele Mulungu kwa ntselo yawo vene. Ihyo Mulungu aganile mwene kuvakulusa vala wo vamutumbye kwa wujumbe wa Yesu Chilisito wo vanguwuchema vanji kuta “Wupufi,” lechelelo vala wo vangutsitumba itso Ndongwa Nofu tso tungutsivikula, vankuluswa. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Vayawudi ili vatumbe van'gana ndajilo na miwujitsa, nawo Vajilichi ili vatumbe van'gana ntselo. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Lechelelo hetwe tunvikula Ndongwa tsa Chilisito yo avambitwe mu musalaba, ndongwa itso kwa Vayawudi tsinguvavifya na kwa Vajilichi nawo vangutsiwona kota wupufi hela, <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />lechelelo kwa vala wovachemilwe na Mulungu vave Vayawudi awu Vajilichi, kwawo Chilisito wo wuvetso wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Lechelelo chila cho chin'woneka kuta wo wupufi wa Mulungu, icho chochina mana kulutila ntselo tsa chiwunu, na kaha chila chochin'woneka kuta wutenyanjifu wa Mulungu china wuvetso kulutila wuvetso wa vanu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Vang'olotsangu, mwiwukaje hala Mulungu ho avachemaga, kwa mahotso ga vanu simwawonekaga kuta muna ntselo na malifwa nambe ga chiwunu hela, na vamwinga simwavaga vanu vatambulwa na kaha simwahumye mu kaye nambulwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Lechelelo Mulungu avahagwe vanu wo van'woneka kuva vapufi muinyi ili avahonjele nyoni vanu vanya ntselo, na kaha avahagwe vanu vala vatenyanjifu ili avahonjele nyoni vala vanu vanya wuvetso. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Kaha Mulungu avahagwe vanu vala wo vam'bedalwa na vanu wo vanhotswa kuta valikuduhu, ili avananje vala vatambulwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Duve, Mulungu adisile ihyo ili munu yoyuve aleche kidutsa kuta munya ntselo, awu kuta mwene yo mutambulwa kulutila munu yunji. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Lechelelo Mulungu mwene yo atuhantsitse na Chilisito Yesu. Nayo amudisile Chilisito ave ntselo yetu na kukolela kwa Chilisito tuve vawuya na vahagulwa va Mulungu, tugombulwe kuhuma mu ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Kota Mandiko fyo ganlonga kuta, “Munya kugana kidutsa, idutsaje kwasawuli ya katsi tsa Mutwa tso yo adisile kwake.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Wujumbe wa Chilisito kuvambwa mu musalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Vang'olotsangu hala ho ntsavaga kutsa kwenyu, ntsavavikulye wujumbe wa wukweli wa Mulungu. Sintsavavikulye kwa wusugu ili kuvalajila kuta heni ntsina ntselo tsa chiwunu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Kwakuva hontsavaga hamwe na henye ntsalamwe kusemwa chila chinu hagati henyu, ila ntsimutsele Yesu Chilisito yo afwilye kwa kuvambwa mu musalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Hontsavaga kutsa kwenyu, ntsiwonaga kuta singuvetsa kudita hili fyo aganaga Chilisito, ihyo ngavaje muloto na kukakama ndalahela, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />madahitso na wujumbe wangu sifyavaga fya kuvagongoletsa vanu na kwa ntselo tsa chiwunu hela, ila ntsaditaga ihyo kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Ntsadisile ihyo ili litumbilo lyenyu live lya kihuvila wuvetso wa Mulungu na siyo kwa ntselo tsa vanu hela.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntselo ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Lechelelo twalongaga kwa ntselo hagati ha vanu wo vakanje mu litumbilo, siyo kwa ntselo tsa mu inyi yino awu ya vatavala va inyi yino wo vali mwikuga lya kuyaga. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ntselo yo tunayo yo ntselo ya wukweli ya Mulungu yo sinambeyitselaniche kwa vanu, lechelelo avaga atuvichye hetwe luhuma hala inyi hoyavaga ying'acha kuwumbwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Kuduhu nambe mutavala yumwe va inyi yo alutselye lulongwa luno. Kwakuva vaka vave valutselye, sivakakuva vamuvambite ndaya mu musalaba Mutwa va wumelemo. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Lechelelo kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Ndongwa tsila tso munu yo avaga ang'ali kutsiwona, nambe kuhulika na lipilichilo, na nambe kwinjila mu numbula, nambe munu yoyuve kutsihotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">ndongwa itso Mulungu avaviche vala wo anguvagana.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Lechelelo Mulungu atugubulye ndongwa tsino kwa Muhe vake. Kwakuva Muhe va Mulungu ahimaga chila chinu, nambe ndongwa tsila tsa mugati ndalahela mwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Mbe, nani yo afuluche atsitsele ndongwa tsotsili mugati mwa munu, kulutila numbula ya munu uyo? Ho hihyo, kuduhu munu yo atselaga ndongwa tsa Mulungu ila Muhe va Mulungu ng'ani. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Lelo hetwe, situkanuche muhe va mu inyi yino, ila tukanuche Muhe va Mulungu, ili tuvetse kutsela fila fyo tumpelwa bule kuhuma kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ihyo lelo, hetwe si tunlonga kwa ntselo ya chiwunu ndaya, ila tunlonga kwa kudahitswa na Muhe, na kudahitsa ndongwa tsa chimuhe kwa vanu vala wo vana Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Duve munu yo sinambeitumbe, siafuluche anuchile ndongwa tsa Muhe va Mulungu, kwakuva an'wona kota wupuva hela, ihyo siafuluche atselewe kwasawuli ndongwa itso tselewekaga kukolela kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Munu yo anlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu ahimaga na kulamula hila fyo yin'ganika, lechelelo mwene si afuluche ahigwe na munu yoyuve. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Nani yo afuluche agatsele mahotso ga Mutwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Nani yo afuluche amudahitse chinu cha kudita?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Lechelelo hetwe tunago mahotso ga Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Vatantsi va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Vang'olotsangu, heni sintsavadahitse henye kota ntsinguvadahitsa vanu wo vanlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu ila ntsavaga ntsinguvadahitsa kota vanu wo sinambevitumbe, na kaha kota vana vadodo mu litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Ntsavadahitsaga ndongwa mefu kota yuva fyo amung'wesaga matsiva mwana mudodo, sintsavalisise chilyo, kwakuva simwavaga munvetsa kulya. Nambe sambi sinambemuvetse kulya chilyo, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />kwasawuli henye mung'acha mungikala kota vanu va mu inyi fyo vangikala. Kwakuva hagati henyu muna wifu na mumpungana. Mbe, kwa ndongwa itso henye simuli kota vanu va mu inyi? Kaha simungikala kota vanu wo sinambevitumbe? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Manyi yumwe venyu an'longa, “Heni tsingumudichila Pawulo,” na yunji, “Heni tsingumudichila Apolo,” Mbe, ihyo siyinlajila kuta henye mungikala kota vanu va kawayida hela? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Mbe, Apolo yo nani? Nayo Pawulo yo nani? Hetwe tuli vatantsi hela wo twavatantsile henye ili mumutumbe Chilisito. Chila munu ankola katsi yo apelilwe na Mutwa. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Heni ntsayatsile nyadikwa, Apolo aboholye malenga, lechelelo Mulungu yo akalagitsaga. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Ihyo munya kuyala nyadikwa na munya kuboholela malenga iwo veka si chinu ndaya, ila va mana Mulungu munya kukalagitsa. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Yula yo ayatsile nyadikwa na yula yo aboholye malenga veka vali sava, lechelelo chila munu akupelwa chifunje kota hila fyo adisile katsi yake. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Kwakuva heni na Apolo tunkola katsi ya Mulungu, na henye wo muli mugunda gwake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Kaha muli Nyumba yake. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu, mbeye mulongola kuvavikulila wujumbe wa Chilisito, kota hila mutsentsi va nyumba fyo antsaga kutsenga nyumba, lelo vadahitswa vanji vankutsa kuvadahitsa kota hila mutsentsi yunji fyo ankutsa kutseka mwilanga mwake. Lechelelo chila mutsentsi an'ganika iyangalile hila fyo akutsenga mwilanga mwake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kuduhu mutsentsi yunji yo afuluche kuvika musinji gunji kulutila gula go gwantsitse kutsengwa, kwakuva Yesu Chilisito yo musinji. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Iwo vadahitsi wo van'dahitsa Ndongwa tsa Mulungu kota fyo yin'ganika, vakuva kota vatsentsi wo van'tsenga kwa madini ga tsahabu, awu madini ga fwetsa awu maganga ganya beyi ngomi, lechelelo vadahitsi wo sinambe vadahitse kota fyo yin'ganika vakuva kota vatsentsi wo van'tsenga kwa mibichi, awu kwa mihamba awu misoli. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Ihyo chila katsi yikuwoneka hila fyoyili, kwasawuli Siku yila yo akutsa Chilisito yikutsa na moto na chila katsi ya munu yikupimwa kwa moto, na moto ugo gukuhima yila katsi ya chila munu kulajila fyoyili. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Manyi katsi ya munu yo adisile yileche kulalila mu moto, akwanuchila chifunje chake. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Lechelelo manyi katsi ya munu yilalile mu moto, duve uyo munu siakupata chifunje, ila mwene akukuluswa kota akulwiche kuhuma mu moto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Mbe, sinambe mutsele kuta henye muli Nyumba ya Mulungu na Muhe va Mulungu angikala mugati mwenyu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Manyi munu yoyuve ananje Nyumba ya Mulungu, Mulungu akumwananga munu uyo, kwasawuli Nyumba ya Mulungu yo nyagulwa, nayo Nyumba iyo yo henye.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Mulekaje kideteletsa. Munu yoyuve hagati henyu manyi angiwona kuta ana malifwa ga ndongwa tsa mu inyi yino, chiba ave mupuva ili ave na malifwa ga wukweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kwakuva malifwa ga vanu va inyi yino go wupuva hela halutalo ha Mulungu. Kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko, “Mulungu avagwilitsaga vanya malifwa mu wusugu wawo.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Na kaha yandikwe, “Mutwa an'tsela kuta mahontso ga vanya malifwa siyo chinu ndaya.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Lelo, munu alekaje kihuvila chila cho vanu vafuluche vadite. Kwasawuli vavisilwe na Mulungu ili vavatumichile henye, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Mulekaje kihuvila Pawulo awu Apolo na Chefwa, hetwe tweka va henye. Inyi yino, wumi awu chifo, chipindi cha sambi awu cho chinkutsa, ifi fyeka fyenyu, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />na henye muli vanu va Chilisito, nayo Chilisito yo va Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Vatantsi va Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Ihyo duve, vanu vatutselaje kuta hetwe tuli vajumbe va Chilisito, na Mulungu atutumile hetwe tukavalonjele vanu wujumbe wake wo avaga siamulonje munu yoyuve. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Cho chin'ganika kwa munu yoyuve, an'ganika ave va kitumbilwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Lechelelo kwa heni si chinu manyi nguhigwa na henye, awu na vanu va kaye tsa wuhigo manyi ndisile finofu awu fibi, nayivaje heni ntsi mwene sifuluche ntsihije. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Fyontsinhotsa heni kuduhuli lulongwa loluve lo lun'nyiga kwa chinu chochive, lechelelo kwa lulongwa ulo sifuluche ntsiwone kuta ntsilihela wubi wowuve. Ila Mutwa yo munya kunyiga heni. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ihyo lelo mwalahogola kumuhiga munu yoyuve hala luvala lwake lung'acha lung'ali kufika, mutsindaje mbaka hala Mutwa ho akuva atsitse. Mwene yo akutsivika mu mwangatsa ndongwa tsila tseka tsotsifihilwe, na kuvika helu gala mahotso gogali mu numbula tsa vanu. Luvala ulo chila munu akwanuchila chila cho an'ganika kuhombwa kuhuma kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Lelo vang'olotsangu, ndongwa itsi tso ndontsile kwajili ya Apolo na heni, ntsin'gana tsive muhwano kuhuma kwa hetwe na kuyitsela mana ya wulontsi wowunlonga kuta, “Muhulikitsaje chila cho chandikwe.” Kwakudita ihyo hagati henyu kukuva kuduhuli munu yo angihuvila munu yumwe na kumubedala yunji. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Mbe, nani yo akudisile uve muvina kulutila vanu vanji? Una chinu chachi cho siukapelitwe na Mulungu? Lelo manyi ukanuchilye kwasawuli yachi ungidutsa kota hila siulapelwa?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Mbe, mungiwona kuta mwanga mwigwite? Mbe, ndawuli vayetu, mwanga muveye vafuchifu? Mbe, muveye vantsajila bila ya hetwe? Eee nachene! Yikakuva finofu muve vatavala, ili na hetwe tuve vatavala hamwe na henye! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ntsinhotsa kuta Mulungu atudisile hetwe vatumi tuve vanu va hawudugo, kwasawuli tuveye kota vanu wo vahijitwe kufwa. Kaha tuveye kota chinu cha kuhesa halutalo ha vanu, na halutalo ha inyi yeka na ha vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Hetwe tuli vapuva kwasawuli ya Chilisito, lechelelo henye wo muna malifwa molofu kwa kihantsa na Chilisito. Hetwe tuvatenyanjifu, lechelelo henye muna wuvetso. Henye munhesimilwa, ila hetwe tum'bedalwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mbaka sambi tuna ntsala na ng'alu, tulihela myenda, tutofilwe na kaha tulihela hono ha kikala, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />kaha tunkola katsi kwa mawoko getu kwa kugatsika. Hotunligwa tunguvasuchila wuwuya kwa Mulungu na hotunkodwa tungikangatsa, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />manyi vatulonje kwa kutuwonela, tunguvajibula kwa kuvagongola. Mbaka sambi mu inyi vanu vangutuwona kota tulichaaka hela!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Sintsinguvandichila henye ndongwa tsino, kwasawuli ya kuvahonjela nyoni ndaya, lechelelo tsivandichilye ili kuvafunda kota muli vanangu wo ntsinguvagana. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Nambe muve na vadahitsi elufu kumi mulitumbilo lya Chilisito, lechelelo mulihela vadada wolofu, kwakuva kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, heni mbeye ntsili dada venyu kwa kuvaletela Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Ihyo ntsinguvagongola kuta henye muntsigaje heni. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Kwasawuli iyo ntsingumutuma kwenyu Timoseyo, mwene yo mwanangu mwendi na vakitumbilwa mulitumbilo lya Chilisito. Akuviwusa henye mutsele hila fyo ntsingikala kota mufwasi va Chilisito Yesu, kota fyo ntsin'dahitsa chila hono hovali vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Hagati henyu hana vanu vamwe vana chidada vangidutsa kuta singutsa kaha kuvajendela henye. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Lechelelo manyi Mutwa angavile, luvala loluve siku tsitsinago ngutsa kwenyu, na iho hongutsa ntsele vanu iwo wo vangidutsa vanlonga chinu chachi na vana wuvetso wachi. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kwasawuli Wuntsajila wa Mulungu siyo kuva na wuvetso wa kulonga longa hela, ila yin'ganika kuva na wuvetso wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Henye mun'gana chichi? Hala honguva ntsinkutsa kwenyu tsitse na chinu chachi? Ntsitse na mkotya, awu ntsitse kwa numbula ya wugano na ya wudeche?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Munu mwaafu siaganikaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Kotsili ndongwa tso tsitagalye kuta mun'dita waafu, wo sinambewuditwe nambe na vanu wo sinambevamutumbile Mulungu. Kuta munu an'dita waafu na mudala va dade. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Na henye mungidutsila chinu chachi? Mbe si mun'ganika kususutala na kumubagula kutali na henye munu yo adisile ndongwa itso? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Nayivaje sintsilihamwe na henye, lechelelo tulihamwe chimuhe. Heni mwanga ntsimuhitsile munu yo adisile lulongwa ulo kota hila fyo ntsikakumuhiga hala ho ntsikakuva iho. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Hala ho munkuva mukong'ine kwasawuli ya kumufugamila Mutwa vetu Yesu na heni ntsili hamwe na henye chimuhe, na wuvetso va Mutwa vetu Yesu wulihamwe na hetwe, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />mumutawulaje munu uyo kwa Lihoka, ili muvili gwake gutowe na kumudita munu uyo aleche ndongwa ntsibi na muhe gwake gukuluswe mu Siku yila ya Mutwa Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kidutsa kwenyu si kunofu ndaya! Mbe, sinambe mutsele kuta hamila ndodo yitsatsamulaga lidonje lyeka lya wuse wa ngano? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Mutsiditaje numbula tsenyu tsive ng'wemufu na kuyitaga yila hamila ya katali, ili muve lidonje lipya lya wuse wa ngano lyo lilihela hamila, kota fyo mun'ganika muve. Kwasawuli Chilisito Mwana Ng'olo vetu va liwungo lya Pasaka mwanga atawulwe kuva nambiko. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Ihyo tuliditaje liwungo lya Pasaka, kuno mugati mwetu tulihela hamila ya katali, yo ndongwa ntsibi na wubi, ila tuyidite kwa mukate go siguvisilwe hamila, uwo wo welu wa numbula na wukweli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Ntsandiche mu baluva yangu kuta mwalahogola kihantsa na vanu vaafu. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Sintsinlonga kuta mulekaje kihantsa nachene na vanu va mu inyi yino, vanu wo van'dita waafu awu wo vangiwiniwa, awu vawumiyani, awu wo vangujifugamila misanamu. Manyi yikayive ihyo mukakuganika kuhega mu inyi. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Mbije na mana kuta mwalahogola kihantsa na munu yoyuve yo angichema munyalukolo venyu, kuno an'dita waafu, awu munya kiwiniwa, awu munya kufugamila misanamu, awu muligaji, awu muwumiyani, awu mugatsi, awu mudesi, uyo munu yo an'dita ndongwa itso mwalahogola nambe kulya hamwe nayo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Mbe, ntsin'ganika kuvahiga vanu wo valihela litumbilo? Ndaya, iwo vakuhigwa na Mulungu mwene. Henye mun'ganika muvahije vala wo mulihamwe nawo mu litumbilo. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Mulungu akuvahiga iwo wo sinambevamutumbile, “Henye mumuhetse uyo yo an'dita wubi yoali hagati henyu!”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Mulekaje kisindika mu kaye tsa wuhigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Manyi hagati henyu hana munu vitachye na mung'olotse, afuluche ndawuli kumusindika kwa vanu wosi vamutumbye Mulungu ili valamulwe, na kuleka kumusindika kwa vanu va Mulungu? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Mbe, simun'tsela kuta vanu va Mulungu wo vakuvahiga vanu va mu inyi? Manyi mukuvahiga vanu va mu inyi, mufuluche mulemwe ndawuli kulamula ndongwa ndodo ndodo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Mbe, simun'tsela kuta tukuvahiga vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu? Mbe, tukulemwa ndawuli kulamula ndongwa tsa kawayida hela tsa chila siku? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Ihyo manyi kuna chitika cha ndongwa itsi hagati henyu, kwasawuli ya chichi munsindika ndongwa tsenyu kwa vanu wo munguvabedala kwa ndongwa tsa litumbilo lyenyu lya Chilisito ili vavalamule? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ntsinlonga ihi ili muwone nyoni! Mbe, hagati henyu haduhuli mung'olotsenyu nambe yumwe munya ntselo yo afuluche avalamule? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Lechelelo henye mungusindika mu nyumba tsa kuhijila, na kihiga halutalo ha vanu wo valihela litumbilo lya Chilisito ili vavalamule.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Uko kuna ndongwa tsa kuhigana henye kwa henye tso tsinlajila kuta mulemulwe nachene. Kwasawuli yachi mulema kukatuka hela, mbe si finofu henye kuditilwa wubi? Kaha si finofu kusukulwa finu fyenyu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Lechelelo, henye wo mungiditila fibi na kisukula finu henye kwa henye. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Mbe, simun'tsela kuta vanu wo van'dita wubi sivafuluche vinjile mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu? Mwalahogola kudeteletswa kuta vanu vaafu awu wo vanfugamila misanamu, awu wo van'dita waafu na valume vayawo, awu wo vanguvinjilila finji vayawo, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />awu vahitsi, awu kiwiniwa finu fya vayawo five fyawo, awu vagatsi, awu vahehi, awu vawumiyani, iwo veka sivakwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Vamwe mwavaga hihyo, lechelelo sambi muhofugwe na kuditwa muve vanu va Mulungu na kuditwa kuva vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu, na kidichilwa na Mulungu kukolela kwa Mutwa Yesu Chilisito na kwa Muhe va Mulungu vetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumila mivili kumutsumitsa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Munu yumwe afuluche alonje kuta, “Finu fyeka finofu kwa heni.” Eee, lechelelo siyo finu fyeka fyo un'ganika kufidita. Na heni ntsinguvalonjela kuta, sifuluche ntsichidite chinu chochive chinavale heni. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Munu yumwe afuluche alonje, “Chilyo kochili kwasawuli ya lileme, na lileme kwasawuli ya chilyo.” Eee, lechelelo Mulungu akufyananga fyeka fivili. Mulungu aguwumbite muvili gwa munu siyo kwasawuli ya kudita waafu, lechelelo muvili guli kwasawuli ya kumutumichila Mutwa, nayo Mutwa yo agutuntsaga muvili na kugupela chilyo. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nayo Mulungu yo amutsilipwe Mutwa Yesu, uyo akututsilipula na hetwe kwa wuvetso wake.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Mbe, simun'tsela kuta mivili jenyu jo filungo fya Chilisito? Ino lelo filungo fya muvili gwa Chilisito fifuluche fihantse na mivili jo jin'dita waafu? Ndaya bee! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Mbe, simun'tsela kuta munu yo ihantsitse na munu yo an'dita waafu ankuva muvili gumwe na mwene? Kwasawuli kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu, “Iwo vavili vakuva muvili gumwe.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Lechelelo munu yo ihantsitse na Mutwa, uyo ankuva Muhe gumwe na Mutwa.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ihyo mubilime ndongwa tsa waafu. Kwasawuli chila ndongwa ntsibi tso aditaga munu aditaga mwivala mwa muvili gwake, lechelelo munu yo an'dita ndongwa ntsibi ya waafu ankuva angiditila mwene mu muvili gwake. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Mbe, simun'tsela kuta mivili jenyu yo Nyumba ya Muhe wa Mulungu yo angikala mugati mwenyu, yo mupelitwe na Mulungu? Ihyo mivili si jenyu muvene, ila ja Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />yo avagutsile kwa galama ngomi ndalahela. Ihyo lelo mumutsumitsaje Mulungu kwa mivili jenyu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga kutolana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Duve kwa ndongwa tsila tso mwantsandichilye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Munlonga kuta, yikakuva chiba mulume aleche kutola. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Lelo kwasawuli ya kulutila kwa ndongwa tsa waafu, chila mulume avaje na mudala vake mwene, na chila mudala avaje na mulume vake mwene. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Mulume an'ganika akwilitsaje chila cho chin'ganika kukwitsa kwa mudala vake, nayo mudala akwilitsaje cho an'ganika kukwitsa kwa mulume. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Mudala alihela mamulaka kwa muvili gwake aliyena ila na mulume vake nayo, na hihyo mulume nayo alihela mamulaka kwa muvili gwake, ila na mudala vake. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Mulekaje kiyima mivili jenyu, lechelelo hala hela ho mukuva mupatine kwa luvala lutunga, ila hala ho mukuva mulagine kumusuka Mulungu. Na hala ho mukuva musintsile kusuka muwuye kaha, ili Lihoka lileche kupata nyafwasi ya kuvajela kwasawuli ya kulemwa kikangatsa.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ndongwa itso tseka ndontsile heni hela, sinambe ntsivagwagwaditse ndaya. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Nganije vanu veka muvaje kota heni fyontsili, lechelelo chila munu apelitwe chifunje chake kuhuma kwa Mulungu. Yumwe chifunje chake chili ihi na yunji chili hino.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Lechelelo ntsinlonga kuta vala wo sivatolite na vafwile, yika kuva chiba vasigale hihyo kota heni fyontsili. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Lechelelo manyi vanlemwa kutsisuma mbwiniwo tsawo, duve nawo vatole na kutoleka, kwasawuli chiba kutola awu kutoleka kuliko kiwiniwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kwa vala wo mwanga vitweye tsinguvapela malajitso iga kuta, mudala alahogola kulekana na mulume vake, iga go malagitso ga Mutwa siyo heni ndaya. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Lechelelo manyi mudala valekane na mulume vake an'ganika aleche kutoleka kaha. Manyi si ihyo ipilule kaha kwa mulume vake. Nayo mulume nayo alahogola kumuleka mudala vake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Lechelelo kwa vala vanji ntsinlonga kuta, manyi mung'olotsenyu anayo mudala yo sinambeamutumbye Mutwa, na uyo mudala idiche kikala hamwe nayo, duve alekaje kumuleka. Lulongwa luno ntsinlonga heni hela siyo Mutwa ndaya. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nayo mudala munya mulume yo sinambeamutumbye Chilisito, na mulume uyo idiche kikala hamwe nayo, duve mudala uyo alekaje kumuleka mulume uyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kwakuva uyo mulume yo sinambeamutumbye Chilisito akudichilwa na Mulungu kwa kihantsa na mudala vake, nayo mudala yo sinambeamutumbye Chilisito akudichilwa na Mulungu kwa kihantsa na mulume vake. Manyi yikayive si ihyo vana venyu sivakakudichilwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Lechelelo yula yo alihela litumbilo manyi agane kumuleka yula munya litumbilo, iho uyo mudala awu uyo mulume munya litumbilo akuva hulu. Kwasawuli Mulungu avachemile henye ili mwikale kwa wusichimafu. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Heve mudala, un'tsela ndawuli kuta ufuluche umulongotse mulume vako ku wukuluso wa Mutwa? Nambe na heve mulume un'tsela ndawuli kuta ufuluche umulongotse mudala vako ku wukuluso wa Mutwa?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikala kota fyo twachemilwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Chila munu ikilaje kota hila Mutwa fyo amugavye, mwikalaje kota hila Mulungu fyo avachemile. Iga go malajitso go ntsinguvapela vanu veka wo vamutumbye Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Manyi munu mulume achemilwe kuno inje likumbi, alekaje kiyatsa kuta mwene si inje likumbi. Na manyi achemilwe kuno si inje likumbi, alekaje kugwagwaditswa ili injile likumbi. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kwakuva kwinjila likumbi na kuleka kwinjila likumbi siyo chinu chinya mana ngomi ndaya! Chinu cho ching'anika kuhulikitsa malagitso ga Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Ihyo chila yumwe asigalaje hihila kota fyo avaga hala ho achemwaga na Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Mbe, heve ho wachemwagwa wavaga mutantsi va munu? Lulongwa ulo lulekaje kukutifya, lechelelo manyi ufuluche kuwuleka uwo wutantsi, duve udite hihyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo achemilwe na Mutwa kuno alimutantsi va munu, uyo ankuva mugombolwa kwa Mutwa. Kota hila fyovali iwo wo vachemilwe kuno siyo vatantsi va munu, lelo vaveye vatantsi va Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mulungu akavagombwe kwa galama ngomi, ihyo muleche kuva vatantsi va munu yoyuve. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Vang'olotsangu, chila munu asigalaje hihilaga kota hala fyo achemwaga na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa Wosivatoliche na Vafwile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Ino lelo ntsiguvandichila lulongwa lwa vala vahintsa wo vang'ali kutoleka, lo mwavaga muntsandichilye kumbutsa. Heni ntsilihela malagitso go gahumye kwa Mutwa. Lechelelo mun'ganika munumbe chila cho ntsinguvalonjela.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Kwasawuli ya ndongwa fyotsili kwa luvala ulu, yikakuva chiba musigale kota fyomuli. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Mbe, utolite? Walahogola kugana mwileche. Mbe, siulatola? Walahogola kutola. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Lechelelo manyi utole ukuva siudisile ndongwa ntsibi, na kaha muhintsa yo akutoleka akuva siadisile ndongwa ntsibi. Lechelelo wo vakuva vatoliche na kutola vakugatsika chila siku, na heni nganije kuvatanga ili valeche kugatsika.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Lechelelo vang'olotsangu ntsin'gana kulonga hino. Lusije luvala ludodo hela, lelo luhuma sambi vala wo vatolite van'ganika vikale kota sivalatola, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />na vala wo vanvemba vikalaje kota sinambevavembe, na vala wo vanhechelela vikalaje kota vasusutafu, nawo wo van'gula finu vikaleje kota hila valihela finu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />na vala wo vampipika na finu fya mu inyi yino, vavaje kota si vampipilika ndalahela na ndongwa itso. Kwasawuli kota hila fyo tun'tsela nachene kuta, inyi yinlutila.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Ntsin'gana henye mulekaje kupipilika. Kwasawuli munu yo siatolite aditaga ndongwa tso angutsigana Mutwa ng'ani, kwasawuli an'gana kumudita Mutwa ahechelele. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Lechelelo munu yo atolite ankuva an'dita ndongwa tsa mu inyi yino, kwasawuli an'gana mudala vake ahechelele, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />na kaha mahotso gake gavaga gavili gavili. Nayo muhintsa yo siatoliche aditaga ndongwa tso angutsigana Mutwa ng'ani, kwasawuli an'gana kumudita Mutwa ahechelele, ili ave muhagulwa na itawule kwa muvili na muhe gwake kwa Mutwa. Lechelelo yula yo atoliche akuva an'dita ndongwa tsa mu inyi yino, kwasawuli an'gana mulume vake ahechelele.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa itsi ili ntsivatanje, siyo kuta ntsinguvalemetsa. Lechelelo ntsin'gana mwikale finofu ili mumutumichila Mutwa finofu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Manyi munu yoyuve yo an'wona kuta sinambeamutole muhintsa yo vapatine kutolana, na mbwiniwo tsa mulume uyo tsinlutila. Nayo uyo muhintsa fyo ankwendelela kikala anlutila umuli wake wa noleka. Van'ganika vitole hela, kwa kudita ihyo sivakuva van'dita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Lechelelo manyi mwene uyo mulume alamule finji mu numbula yake na kuleka kumutola uyo muhintsa, na manyi anawo wuvetso wa kutsisuma mbwiniwo tsake, akuva adisile finofu hilo kwa kuleka kumutola muhintsa uyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Ihyo mulume yula yo akulamula kumutola muhintsa yo aganije kumutola, akuva adisile finofu. Na mulume yula yo akikala bila kutola, nayo akuva adisile finofu hilo.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mudala an'ganika kikala na mulume vake luvala lweka lwa wumi wawo. Lechelelo manyi mulume uyo atajiche, mudala uyo afuluche atoleche na mulume yoyuve yo angumugana mwene. Ila mulume uyo an'ganika ave angumutumba Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Lechelelo hila fyo ntsin'wona heni, yikakuva chiba asigale mufwile. Ila ndongwa itso ntsinlonga heni hela, nambe ihyo ntsintumba kuta na heni ntsinayo Muhe va Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Filyo fyofitawulwe nambiko kwa sanamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Lelo ntsin'gana kuvandichila lulongwa lunji lo mwambutsitse kwajili ya filyo fya nambiko fyo fitawulwe kwa sanamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Kuna wukweli kuta, “Hetwe tweka tunago malifwa kota fyo munlonga.” Lechelelo malifwa gano ganguvambutsa vanu kidutsa, ila wugano wutuditaga tuvatanje vanu vanji. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Yula yo anhotsa kuta an'tsela lulongwa lutunga, ang'ali kutsela kota fyo yin'ganika kutsela. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Lechelelo munu yo angumugana Mulungu, uyo antselanika na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Ihyo kwajili ya chilyo cho chitawulwe sadaka kwa sanamu, tun'tsela kuta, sanamu si chinu ndaya mu inyi yino, na kaha tun'tsela kuta hoyoli Mulungu yumwe hela. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Nambe kuna finu fyofinchemwa “mihoka,” jojingikala kilanga awu mu inyi, nayivaje kweli kojili “mihoka myolofu” Na “vatwa wolofu,” <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />lechelelo hetwe tunayo Mulungu yumwe hela, nayo yo Dada vetu. Finu fyeka fyawumbitwe na mwene yo angutudita tuve na wumi. Kaha hoyoli Mutwa yumwe hela yo Yesu Chilisito, na finu fyeka fihumye kwa mwene na hetwe tungikala kwasawuli yake.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Lechelelo siyo chila munu yo angulutsela finofu lulongwa luno. Kwasawuli kuna vanu vatunga wo vatsovye kutambichila misanamu. Ihyo mbaka sambi ho vankulya filyo ifyo vafiwonaga kuta fitambichilwe kwa sanamu. Na kwakuva sivitumbye kota fyo yin'ganika vankuva sinambe vidichilwe halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Lechelelo chilyo sichifuluche chituviche tuve habehi na Mulungu, na manyi tuleche kulya situkupunguchilwa chinu, kaha manyi tulye situkuwilwa chinu chochive kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Lechelelo mwiyangalilaje, wula wuhulu wenyu wuleche kuva chambutso kwa vanya litumbilo lidodo kudita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kwasawuli munu munya litumbilo lidodo manyi akuwone “heve yo una malifwa makomi,” unkulya filyo ifyo mu nyumba tsa kufugamila misanamu, mbe, si akuwona kuta afuluche na mwene alye filyo fyo fitawulwe nambiko tsa sanamu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Ihyo uyo mung'olotso munya litumbilo lidodo, yo Chilisito afweye kwasawuli yake, afuluche ayaje kwasawuli ya “malifwa gako!” <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Hala ho munguvambutsa vang'olotsenyu vanya litumbilo lidodo vadite ndongwa ntsibi chinya ihyo na kuvatetsa, unkuva ungumukosela Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ihyo lelo, manyi chilyo cho ntsinkulya chikumwambutsa munya litumbilo muyangu adite ndongwa ntsibi, singuhogola kulya nyama siku tseka, ili ndeche kumuwambutsa mung'olotsangu adite ndongwa ntsibi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Katsi na ndongwa tso ntsin'ganika aditilwe mutumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Mbe, heni ntsili muwopwa? Mbe, heni siyo mutumi? Mbe, heni sitsamuwene Yesu Mutwa vetu? Mbe, sitsavalongwitse kumutumba Mutwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Nayivaje heni sintsili mutumi kwa vanu vanji, lechelelo kwa henye heni ntsili mutumi venyu, henye yo chitango cha wutumi wangu kwasawuli ya kihantsa kwenyu na Mutwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ihyo fyo ntsipamanaga kwa vanu vala wo vansumwana na heni. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Mbe, heni ng'ani yo sinambenganiche kupelwa filyo na fya kung'wa mu katsi yangu? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Mbe, heni ng'ani yo sintsin'ganika kujenda mu njendo ntsangu hamwe na mudala vangu yo amutumbye mutwa kota hila fyo van'dita vatumi vanji, na Chefwa na vadodove va Mutwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Awu heni na Balinaba ng'ani wo tun'ganika kudita katsi ili twigulile finu? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Mbe, koyoli mutova ligalu vachi yo abitaga kuligalu kwa galama tsake mwene? Awu kuna mulimi vachi yo alimaga mugunda gwa mitsabibu bila kulya mibawo jake? Nani yo adimaga chipinga cha fidimwa na aleche kung'wa matsiva ga fidimwa ifyo?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Mbe, ndongwa tsino ntsinlonga longa hela? Mbe, mu malajitso ga Mulungu go amupelye Musa siganlonga hihyo ndaa? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Yandikwe mu malagitso igo kuta, “Ulekaje kuyibinga ng'ambaku mulomo hala ho yintova ngano.” Mbe, muntijila Mulungu atsihijilaga ng'ambaku ng'ani? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Mbe, Mulungu hala ho alongaga ndongwa itso si atuhotselaga na hetwe? Eee, ndongwa itso tsandikwe kwasawuli ya hetwe. Yula yo anlima na yula yo am'beta, veka vavili van'ganika vihuvile filyo fyo fikubetwa. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Manyi yive hetwe twayatsile nyadikwa tsa chimuhe hagati henyu yo ndongwa tsa Mulungu! Mbe, lukuva lulongwa lukomi manyi tubete kwa henye finu fya mumuvili kota filyo na fya kung'wa? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Manyi vanu vanji van'ganika kutangwa na henye! Mbe, na hetwe situn'ganika kutangwa kulutila vanu iwo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Lechelelo hetwe sitwavasusile finu ifyo. Ino lelo tungikangatsa, ili tuleche kwambutsa Ndongwa Nofu ya Chilisito yileche kuvafichila vanu. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Mbe, sinambemutsele kuta vala wo vankola katsi ha Nyumba ya Mulungu valyaga baho ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, na kuta vala wo vankola katsi ya kutawula nambiko tsa kunyanya mu matsabahu valyaga mu nambiko tsitso? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Mutwa nayo alajitse hihyo, kuta vala wo vanvikula Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu vakupata chilyo kuhuma mu Ndongwa Nofu tso vanvikula.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Lechelelo heni sintsadisile ndongwa itso kota fyo ntsaganikaga kudita, na sinambentsandiche ili munditile ihyo. Heni chiba ntsifwe kuliko munu yoyuve antselewe fibi chinu cho ntsingidutsila. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Lecheleo ho ntsinvikula Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu, sifuluche ntsidutse, kwasawuli ntsin'ganika kuvikula. Na ngudutsa manyi ndeche kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Manyi ntsikantsive ntsahagwe katsi yino kwa kugana hela, duve ntsikakihuvila mahombo. Lechelelo sintsahagwe, ila ntsikola yo katsi yangu, kwasawuli Mulungu yo amelye ntsiyidite. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Lelo nguhombwa chinu chachi? Mahombo gangu yo yila nyafwasi ya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu bila kugana mahombo.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Nayivaje heni sintsili mu wuwopwa na siyo mupogotsi va munu yoyuve, tsiditite kuva mupogotsi kwa chila munu ili mbetse kuvakwega vanu wolofu hila ho nguvetsa kuvakwega vamutumbe Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Kwa Vayawudi ntsavaga kota Muyawudi ili ntsivatanje Vayawudi. Nayivaje heni sintsingugahulikitsa malajitso, ntsadisile ihyo ili mbetse kuvatanga vanu vala wo vangugahulikitsa malajitso. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi ntsavaga kota sitsili Muyawudi ili mbetse kuvatanga vala wosi Vayawudi vamutumbe Chilisito. Nayivaje heni sinambenyulikitse malagitso ga Mulungu, ila ntsinhulikitsa malajitso ga Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Kwa vanu vala vatsunwa ntsavaga vatsunwa ili ntsivatanje vatsunwa vamutumbe Chilisito. Mbeye munu va hali tseka kwa vanu veka ili ntsivakuluse vanu vatunga.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ntsin'dita ihyo kwasawuli ya Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu, ili heni na veka wo vakumutumba Chilisito tuwupate wuwuya wa Ndongwa Nofu. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Mbe, sinambemutsele kuta vanu wo vabilimaga mu ntsuga tsa midalawo vasumanaga luvilo veka, lechelelo yumwe hela yo apelwaga ngweko? Mubilimaje hohihyo kwa kusumwana ili mupate ng'weko. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Veka wo vabilimaga luvilo vivikaga chang'ani kwa siku ntsolofu kiyima finu fyolofu, ili siku ya kusumana vapate ngweko, nawo vapataga ngweko yo yinkwananjika, lechelelo hetwe tuditaga ihyo ili tupate ngweko yo sinambeyananjiche. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Hohihyo na heni simbilimaga kota munu yo am'bilima bila kihuvila lulongwa, na si tsingitova kota munu yo antova ng'ala. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Ihyo ntsingugunanahitsa muvili gwangu gudite kota fyo ntsin'gana heni. Ntsin'dita ihyo ili hala honguva sintsile kuvavikulila vanu Ndongwa Nofu, Mulungu aleche kundema.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Muleche kufugamila misanamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Vang'olotsangu, ndema muleche kutsela wukweli wuno kuta vadadetu veka vamilwaga na lila lifuluka, na veka valutilaga hagatinagati mu bahali ya Samu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Vanu veka vakabatitswaje mugati mwa lila lifuluka na mugati mwa yila bahali ili vave vafwasi va Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Veka valyeye chilyo chichilaga cho chahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />na veka vang'weye malenga go atawe Mulungu, kwakuva vang'weye malenga kuhuma mu litalawe lya chimuhe lyo lyafwatanaga nawo, nalyo litalawe ilyo avaga yo Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nambe ihyo vanu wolofu hagati hawo sivadisile kota hila fyo aganaga Mulungu, ihyo vakafwaje na mivili jawo jikatagalilaje mu mbuga.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Duve ndongwa itso tsahumye ili tsive muhwano kwa hetwe, ili tuleche kudita wubi kota vene fyo vadisile. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Mulekaje kufugamila misanamu kota vamwe vawo fyo vaditaga, kota fyo yandikwe mu mandiko, “Vanu vichite hanyi vakalyaje na kung'wa, kaha vakinukaje kuwunga na kudita ndongwa tsa waafu.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Kaha tulekaje kudita waafu kota fyo vadisile iwo, vakafwaje vanu elufu isilini na tsidatu kwa munyi gumwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Kaha tulekaje kumujela Mutwa kota fyo vadisile iwo, vakafwaje kwa kukomwa na ntsoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Mulekaje kukalala kwa tsila ndongwa tso angutsidita Mulungu kota fyo vadisile iwo, na ihyo vakakopolwaje na mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu yo akopolaga.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Ndongwa itso tseka tsavapasile iwo ili kutufunda hetwe tuvanji, natso tsandikwe ili kutudahitsa hetwe wo tungikala luvala luno lwa wudugo inyi.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ihyo, manyi ungiwona kuta wimile nachene mu litumbilo, wiyangalilaje! Ulekaje kisemwa na kugwa kwa kulileka litumbilo. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Majetso geka go mwapasile go gagalaga govanago vanu veka. Nayo Mulungu yo vakihuvilwa, ihyo siakuvaleka mujelwe kulutila wuvetso wo munawo, na kaha hamwe na kujelwa uko, mwene Mulungu akuvapelani wuvetso wa kikangatsa ili muhume umo bila kutachila.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Ihyo vang'olotsangu, mwalahogola kufugamila misanamu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ntsinlonga na henye kota vanu vanya malifwa, mulamule muvene ichi cho ntsinlonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Hala hotunkuva tungumulumba Mulungu kwa chikombe chila cha wuwuya cha Chilyo cha Mutwa, mbe situvaga tunkung'wa hamwe danda ya Chilisito? Mbe, na hala hotunkuva tunkulya hamwe mukate situvaga tungihatsa na muvuli gwa Chilisito? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwasawuli mukate ugo go gumwe hela, na yivaje hetwe tuli wolofu tuli muvili gumwe, kwasawuli tweka tungihatsa mu ugo mukate gumwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Muvahotsaje vanu va Isilaheli. Mbe, vala veka wo vakolaga katsi mu matsabahu wo vala wo valyaga sadaka mu matsabahu. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Lelo ntsigana kulonga chinu chachi? Chilyo cho chitambichilwe ku sanamu cho chinu hilo kulutila filyo finji? Awu kuta sanamu cho chinu chinya mana hilo? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Siyo ihyo ndaya! Lechelelo sadaka tsovantawula vanu wo sivamutsele Mulungu vatawulaga kwa misoka, na siyo kwa Mulungu. Heni sinambengane henye mwihantse nawo kujifugamila misoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Simufuluche kung'wila chikombe cha Mutwa na luvala lulo mung'wele chikombe cha misoka. Kaha simufuluche mwihantse mu liwungo lya Chilyo cha Mutwa na luvala lulo mwihantse mu liwungo lya chilyo cha misoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Mbe, tugana kumudita Mutwa ave na wifu? Kaha mutijila kuta tuna wuvetso hilo kulutila mwene?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Vanu vamwe valongaga, “Hetwe tudichilwe tufidite chila chinu!” Lechelelo heni ntsinlonga kuta siyo chila chinu chinofu. Kaha vamwe valongaga, “Hetwe tudichilwe tufidite chila chinu!” Lechelelo heni ntsinlonga kuta siyo fyeka fyo chifuluche chivatanje vanu. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Ihyo hagati yenyu halekaje kuva na munu yo ansaka ndongwa tsa kumutanga mwene hela, ila chila munu asakaje ndongwa tsa kuvatanga vayage.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Mulyaje nyama tsostive tso tsin'gutswa kwisoko bila kuputsanitsa kwasawuli ya numbula tsenyu. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kwakuva yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu, “Inyi na fyeka fyofili tso mali tsa Mutwa.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Manyi munu yo siamutumbye Chilisito akulibulitse chilyo na heve un'gana kubita, ubite ukalye bila kuputsanitsa kwasawuli ya numbula yako. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Lechelelo manyi munu avalonjele, “Nyama yino yitawulwe kwa sanamu,” duve mulekaje kulya, kwasawuli ya kumutanga uyo yo akulonje ihyo na ili muleche kutetseka mu numbula tsenyu. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Ntsinlonga hino kwasawuli ya kutetsa numbula ya uyo yo akulonje, na siyo kwasawuli ya kutetsa numbula yako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Lechelo mufuluche mumbutse kuta, “Kwasawuli yachi hila fyo ntsin'dita heni, munu yunji anyije?” <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Manyi heni ntsilye chilyo icho kuno tsingumulumba Mulungu, kwasawuli ya chichi nyigwe kwa chilyo cho ntsimulumbite Mulungu?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ihyo chinu chochive chomukuchidita, yive kulya awu kungwa muditaje kwa kumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Mulekaje kuvambutsa Vayawudi awu wosi Vayawudi vagatsiche kumutumba Mulungu, awu munu yoyuve yo amutumbye Chilisito adite ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Muvaje kota heni fyontsili, ntsin'jela kuvadita vanu veka vasangalale kwa hila fyovali, bila kusaka ndongwa tsa kunanga tsimwene, ila ntsinsaka ndongwa tsa kuvatanga vanu veka vavetse kukuluswa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Mutsigaje heni, kota hila heni fyo tsingumwiga Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugubika mutwi luvala lwa kusala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nstinguvatsumila kwasawuli muntsiwuka heni kwa chila lulongwa na mungibata madahitso go tsavapelye. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Lechelelo ntsin'gana mulukagule kuta mutwi gwa chila mulume yo Chilisito, na mutwi gwa chila mudala yo mulume. Nago mutwi gwa Chilisito yo Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Ihyo chila mulume ho ansuka awu kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu kuno agubiche mutwi gwake, angumuhonjela nyoni Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Na chila mudala ho akuva angumusuka Mulungu awu kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu bila kugubika mutwi gwake, akuva angumuhonjela nyoni mulume vake, yo an'dita ihyo ankuva sava na yula yo amotsilwe chibuje. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Manyi mudala yo siagubiche mutwi gwake, duve an'ganika kumoga fwili tsake. Lechelelo yinkuva nyoni kwa mudala kumoga chibuje, duve chiba agubiche mutwi gwake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Lechelelo mulume siaganikaga agubiche mutwi gwake kwasawuli mwene yo muhwano gwa wutukufu wa Mulungu, lechelelo mudala yo wutukufu wa mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Kwasawuli mulume siawumbitwe kuhuma kwa mudala, ila mudala awumbitwe kuhuma kwa mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Mulume siawumbitwe kwasawuli ya kumutanga mudala, ila mudala awumbitwe kwasawuli ya kumutanga mulume. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ihyo yin'ganika mudala agubiche mutwi gwake hala ho ansuka au kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu, yive ndajilo ya mamulaka gogali kwilanga kwake na kaha kwasawuli ya vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Nambe ihyo halutalo ha Mutwa, mudala angumuhuvila mulume na mulume angumuhuvila mudala. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Kota hila mudala fyo awumbitwe kuhuma kwa mulume, fyo hihyo nayo mulume aleliche na mudala. Lechelelo finu fyeka finhuma kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Mulamule henye muvene! Mbe, yinfwaya mudala kumusuka Mulungu bila kugubika mutwi gwake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Mbe, nambe wuwoneko wa mulume fyowuli, siyo nyoni ndaa manyi ave na fwili nali? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Lechelelo kwa mudala manyi ave na fwili nali wo wunofu wake. Kwakuva mudala apelitwe fwili nali ili tsimugubiche. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Manyi munu an'gana kubisa kwa lulongwa ulu, nambe tuve hetwe awu fikundi fya vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito hino fyo tuditaga ho tungumufugamila Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liwungo lya chilyo cha Mutwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayo 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maliko 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lukasi 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Ino lelo kwa malajitso go ntsinguvapela sambi, sifuluche ntsivatsumile ndaya, kwasawuli ho munkong'ana kumufugamila Mulungu wukweli kuta mun'dita ndongwa ntsibi kulutila ndongwa nofu. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Kwantsa nyuliche kuta ho munkong'ana kota chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito munkuva mwitachye henye kwa henye. Naheni kwa chasi chitunga ntsingitumba kuta lulongwa ulo lukuva hihyo. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ntsintumba kwasawuli latsima mwitachile ili yitselaniche kuta vanani wo vangumutumba Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Wukweli ho munkong'ana hamwe kulya, nachene icho cho munkulya chinkuva siyo Chilyo cha Mutwa! <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ntsinlonga ihyo kwasawuli munkulya bila kitsinda, ihyo vanu vamwe vangikala na ntsala na vanji vankulya na kung'wa kwa kulutitsa mbaka van'gala! <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Mbe, mulihela nyumba tsenyu komufuluche mulye na kung'wa? Awu munguvabedala vala wo vamutumbye Mulungu na kuvahonjela nyoni vagayu? Ntsivalonjele chinu chachi? Mbe, ntsivatsumile kwa lulongwa ulu? Ndaya singuhogola ntsivatsumile!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ulu lo lulongwa lo ntsanuche heni kuhuma kwa Mutwa na ntsavaleche henye kuta, mu chilyo chila cho vamwibite Mutwa Yesu, ategwe mukate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />akamulumbaje Mulungu, akagumegaje na kulonga, “Uguno go muvili gwangu go gutawulwe kwasawuli ya henye. Mulyaje hino kwa kuntsiwuka heni.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Hohihyo ho aveye kulya, akategulaje chikombe cha difwayi na kulonga, “Chino cho chikombe cha Lilagano Lipya lyo Mulungu angulilajila kuta lya wukweli kwa danda yangu. Muditaje hino chila ho munkung'wa kwa kuntsiwuka heni.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kwakuva chila luvala homukulya mukate ugo na kung'wela chikombe icho, munkuva munguvavikulila vanu mbaka ho akutsa Chilisito, kuta Chilisito afweye kwasawuli yenyu. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Hoihyo, chila yo akulya mukate ugo na kung'wela chikombe icho cha Mutwa tebe na fyo yin'ganika, akuva na nongwa kwa muvili na danda ya Mutwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Ihyo, munu an'ganika ihime taha mwene hala ho ang'acha kulya mukate ugo na kung'wela chikombe icho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Kwasawuli munu yoyuve yo ankulya na kung'wa bila kutsela mana ya muvili gwa Mutwa, akuva angihiga mwene. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Chino cho chambutse vanu wolofu hagati henyu vave vahohovafu na vamwe vantamika na vamwe mwanga vafweye. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Lechelelo manyi tukatulongole kihima tuvene ho tung'acha kulya, Mulungu siakakutuhiga. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Lechelelo hala ho tunhigwa na Mutwa, tun'dahitswa ili iho hambele tuleche kuhigwa hamwe na vanu va muinyi. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Ihyo vang'olotsangu, hala ho mukuva mukong'ine hamwe ili mulye Chilyo cha Mutwa, mun'ganika mwitsindaje. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Manyi kuna munu yoyuve ave na ntsala, alyaje kukaye kwake, ili hala ho mukukong'ana aleche kwambutsa muhigwe na Mulungu. Lechelelo ndongwa tsinji nguvalonjelani hilo hala honguva kutsa.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Fifunje kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Duve vang'olotsangu, kwa ndongwa tso mwambutsitse tsa fifunje fya Muhe va Mulungu, ndema muleche kutsela. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Mun'tsela kuta hala ho mwavaga sinambemumukagule Mulungu, mwatsangwaga na kuyatswa na misanamu jo jigaya wumi. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Ihyo tsin'gana mutsele kuta kuduhu munu yo anlongontswa na Muhe va Mulungu yo afuluche alonje, “Yesu akotolwe.” Kaha kuduhu munu yo anlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu afuluche alonje, “Yesu yo Mutwa,” manyi ave sinambealongotswe na Muhe va Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Kotsili ayina tsolofu tsa fifunje, lechelelo Muhe va Mulungu yo yuyula yo atawulaga fifunje ifyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Kuna ayina ntsolofu tsa kumutumichila Mutwa, lechelelo Mutwa tungumutumichila yo yuyula. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Kaha kuna utofwawuti wa kukola katsi, lechelelo Mulungu yuyula yo atutangaga kukola katsi itso. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Chila munu apelwaga fifunje na Muhe va Mulungu kwasawuli ya kitanga hetwe kwa hetwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Muhe va Mulungu ampelaga munu yumwe ntselo ya kulonga, na yunji apelwaga na Muhe va Mulungu ndonga yinya malifwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Yuyo Muhe va Mulungu amupelaga munu yumwe chifunje cha kutumba hilo, na yunji amupelaga chifunje cha kuvaponetsa vatamwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Muhe amupelaga yunji chifunje cha kudita miwujitsa, na yunji kulonga wujumbe wa Mulungu, na kwa yunji chifunje cha kudadafula ili kutsela kuta fifunje fino fihumye kwa Muhe va Mulungu awu ndaya. Yunji amupelaga chifunje cha wuvetso wa kulonga ayina tsolofu tsa ndonga, na yunji ampelaga chifunje cha wuwetso wa kudadafula ndonga itso. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Katsi itso tseka tsiditwaga na Muhe va Mulungu yuyo yumwe, nayo yo amupelaga chila munu chifunje kota fyo aganaga mwene.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvili gumwe go guna filungo fyolofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kota hila muvili fyoguli gumwe, nago guna filungo fyolofu, na filungo ifyo fyeka nayivaje fyolofu ila figuditaga muvili guve gumwe, na hihyo fyoyili kwa Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Na yivaje vanu vamwe Vayawudi na vamwe siyo Vayawudi, vamwe vatantsi va vanu, na vayetu vanji vali wuhulu. Lechelelo hetwe tweka tukabatitswe na kung'weswa Muhe va Mulungu yuyo yumwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Muvili gulihela chilungo chimwe hela, ila guna filungo fyolofu. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Manyi ligulu lilonje kuta, “Kwasawuli heni siyo liwoko, ihyo heni siyo va muvili!” Mbe, kwa kulonga ihyo, lifuluche liduje kuva hono ha muvili? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Nalyo lipulichilo likalilonje, “Kwasawuli heni sitsili liho, ihyo heni siyo va muvili!” Mbe, kwa kulonga ihyo likakuduga kuva hono ha muvili? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Manyi muvili gweka guka guve liho, munu akakuhulika chinya ndawuli? Awu manyi muvili gweka gukaguve lipulichilo, munu akakunusa chinya ndawuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Lechelelo Mulungu afivisile filungo mu muvili, chila chimwe kota fyo aganile mwene. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Manyi akaaveafivisile fyeka five chilungo chimwe, muvili gukakuva chinya ndawuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ihyo muvili guna filungo fyolofu, lechelelo muvuli go gumwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Duve, liho silifuluche kulilonjela liwoko, “Ntsigaya sida na heve!” Nambe mutwi sigufuluche gugalonjela magulu, “Ntsilihela sida na henye!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Lechelelo fila filungo fya muvili fyo fiwonekaga fitenyanjifu, ifyo fyo fyamana hilo kulutila fila filungo finji. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Nafyo filungo fila fya muvili fyo tungufiwona figaya hesima, ifyo fyo tungufipela hesima hilo. Nafyo filungo fila fyo filihela nambe wunofu, tufipelaga hesima ya wiyeka, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />na luvala ulo filungo fila fyo finofu sifiganaga hesima iyo. Lechelelo Mulungu afivisile hamwe filungo fya muvili na akavipelaje hesima hilo filungo fila fyo filihela wunofu. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Mulungu adisile ihyo ili kuleche kuva na chitika mu muvili, ila filungo fyeka fitanje chila chimwe na chiyage. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Manyi chilungo chimwe chitechetse, filungilo fyeka fitamaga hamwe nacho, na manyi chilungo chimwe chitsumilwe, duve filungilo fyeka fihechelelaga hamwe nacho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Duve lelo, henye nyeka yo muvili gwa Chilisito, nayo chila yumwe venyu yo chilungo cha muvili ugo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Ihyo Mulungu avisile chila chinu hono hake mu chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, va kwantsa vatumi, va kavili valoli, va kadatu vadahitsi, kahi avisile vala vanya vifunje fya kudita miwujitsa, na vala vakuponetsa, na vala va kuvatanga vayawo, avavisile vanji vave filongotsi, na vanya kulonga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Mbe, veka vatumi? Mbe, veka valoli va Mulungu? Mbe, veka vadahitsi? Mbe, veka vadita miwujitsa? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Mbe, veka vafuluche cha kuponetsa vatamwa? Mbe, veka vafuluche valonje ndonga njentsi? Mbe, veka vafuluche vadadambule ndonga? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ino mwiviniwaje kupata fifunje fyofina mana hilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Heni lelo nguvalajila ng'asi nofu ya kufipata ifyo fifunje fyeka.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kigana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Nayivaje mbetse kulonga kwa kabila tsa vanu na tsa vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, manyi ntsive tsihela wugano, ndonga yangu yinkuva kota litsi lya lijeleni lyo ligaya chinu awu kota litsi lya kukona fyuma. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Nambe ntsive na chifunje cha kuvikula, na kutsela fiho na malifa geka ga Mulungu. Kaha nambaje ntsina litumbilo lyo lifuluche linanje nambe kuhamya fidunda, lechelelo manyi ntsive tsihela wugano, heni si ntsili chinu ndaya. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Manyi nawule chila chinu cho ntsinacho kwa vagayu, na kaha manyi ntsitawule muvili gwangu nyanywe moto na manyi ntsihela wugano, siyikufwaya chinu chochive. <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Munu munya wugano ikangatsaga, avatangaga vanu vanji, munya wugano alihela mbafya, si idayaga na kaha si idutsaga, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />munya wugano si akosaga kuva na hesima, si asakaga ndongwa tsa kumutanga mwene, na kaha siavaga mupefu kuvipa, si iwukaga wubi wowuve, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />kaha munu munya wugano si ahechelelaga wubi ila ahechelelaga ndongwa tsa wukweli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Munya wugano ikangatsaga mu ndongwa tseka, avatumbaga vanu vanji, na ihuvilaga ndongwa tseka.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Wugano siwudugaga. Lechelelo manyi kuve na wuloli wukuduga. Manyi kuve na wulontsi wukuduga, na manyi kuve na fifunje fya kulonga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu ntsikuduga, na kuvaje na malifwa nago gakulutila. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Kwasawuli luvala luno sinambetutsele chila chinu, nambe wuvetso wetu wa kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu wulipinga. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Lechelelo ho wukuva wutsitse wukwilo, fila fyeka fyofili pinga fikuyaga.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Hala hontsavaga ntsili mwana mudodo, ntsalongaga kota mwana mudodo, ntsatselaga na kuhotsa kota mwana mudodo, lelo hala hontsavaga kukalagala na kuva munu muvina, ntsalesile ndongwa tsa chiwana. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Kwakuva cho tunguchiwona sambi sinambe tuchiwone finofu chinakota chili muchiwowo cho chinya ng'ungugu, lechelelo iho hambele tukuchiwola chila chinu finofu. Sambi ntsin'tsela kwa wupinga hela, lechelelo iho hambele tukufitsela finofu nachene kota Mulungu fyo angututsela hetwe nachene.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Ino lelo sambi ndongwa tsino tsidatu tukwendelela kutsidita, natso ndongwa itso tso litumbilo, lihuvilo na kigana. Nawo uwo wugano wo wutsilutye ndongwa itso tsinji.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Fifunje finji fya Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Mwikangatsaje kuva na wugano, na kaha muganaje hilo kuva na fifunje fya kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, ila chifunje chochin'ganika kulutila fyeka kuvikula wujumbe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Munu yo alongaga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu sialongaga na vanu ila alongaga na Mulungu, kwakuva kuduhu munu yo angumwelewa cho anlonga. Ila alongaga ndongwa tsa fiho kwa kutangwa na wuvetso wa muhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Lechelelo yula yo anguvavikulila vanu wujumbe wa Mulungu avatangaga vanu, na kuvahongetsa na kuvakangatsa mu litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Mwene yo alongaga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu ikangatsaga mwene mu numbula yake, lechelelo yula yo anvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu anguvakangatsa vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Heni ntsin'gana henye nyeka mulonje kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, lechelelo kulutila ifyo fyeka ntsin'gana muve na wuvetso wa kuvikula wujumbe wa Mulungu. Kwakuva yula munya wuvetso wa kuvikula wujumbe wa Mulungu avatangaga vanu hilo kulutila yula munya kulonga kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu. Ila han'ganika have na munu va kudadafula chila cho anlonga ili kuvakangatsa vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Ihyo lelo vang'olotsangu, manyi ntsitse kwenyu na kulonga na henye kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu bila kuvadadafulila mukwelewa chinu chachi? Yikuva bule hela, ila yika kuva chiba ndonje na henye kwa wugubulo, awu kwa malifwa, awu kwa madahitso.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Hohihyo nambe kwa finu fyo figaya wumi finya litsi, kota hila fwilimbi awu ching'weng'we, hala ho fintowa fileche kuhumya matsi go gan'tselanika. Mbe, munu afuluche atsele chinya ndawuli kuta ulo lo lwimbo lwachi? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Manyi libalati lipembwe, na munya kupemba aleche kupemba kwa litsi lyo lin'tselanika, nani yo afuluche iviche chang'ani kwasawuli ya ligalu? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Hohihyo na henye nanye manyi mulonje ndongwa tsosinambetsin'tselaniche, vanu vakutsela chinya ndawuli chila cho munlonga? Ndongwa tsenyu tsikuyaga hela. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Kotsili ndonga ntsolofu ku inyi, lechelelo kuduhuli ndonga nambe yimwe yo yilihela mana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Lechelelo manyi ndeche kutsela ndonga ya munu mutunga, heni nguva ntsi mujentsi kwake, na mwene ankuva mujentsi kwa heni. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Hohihyo na henye nanye, mun'ganika kiwiniwa ili muve vanu vanya fifunje fya Muhe va Mulungu, mwikangatsaje ndalahela kupata fila fifuche fyo fikuvakangatsa vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Ihyo lelo, munu yula yo akulonga kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, an'ganiaka asuche kwa Mulungu ili avetse na kudadafula chila cho anlonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Manyi suche kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, nguva ntsinsuka kwa numbula yangu, lechelelo nyala tsangu nambe tsitsele chinu chochive. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nditaje ndawuli lelo? Ngusuka kwa Muhe va Mulungu, na kaha ngusuka kwa luhala lwangu. Ngwimba kwa Muhe va Mulungu, kaha ngwimba kwa luhala lwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Manyi umutsumitse Mulungu kwa chimuhe, munu yunji yo alihagati henyu iho ho mungumufugamila Mulungu yosi nambe atsele cho unlonga, afuluche ndawuli idikitse “Eena” Na kuno sinambe atsele cho unlonga? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Mufuluche muve mungumulumba Mulungu finofu ndalahela, lechelelo munu yunji sinambe atangwe chinu chochive.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ntsingumulumba Mulungu kwakuva heni ntsinlonga kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu kuvalutila henye nyeka. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Lechelelo mugati mwa Nyumba ya Mulungu yikuva chiba ndonje ndongwa tsihanu tsa kuvadahitsa vanu wolofu, kulutila ndonje ndongwa elufu kumi kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Vang'olotsangu, mulekaje kuhotsa kota fyali. Ila mu ndongwa ntsibi muvaje kota vana, lechelelo mu mahotso genyu, muvaje kota vanu wo mukalaje. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Mandiko ga Mulungu gandiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Kukolela kwa vanu vanya wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">na kwa milomo ja vanu vajentsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">ngulonga na vanu vano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">nambe ihyo sivakunyulikitsa ndaya.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Lelo mutselaje kuta chifunje cha kulonga kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu yo ndajilo kwa iwo wo sinambevamutumbile Mulungu, ila chifunje cha kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu siyo kwasawuli ya vala wo sinambevamutumbile, ila kwasawuli ya wo vamutumbye Chilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Ihyo manyi vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito vakong'ine hono hamwe, na chila munu ankwantsa kulonga kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, lelo manyi vinjile vanu vanji wo sinambe vatsele awu valihela litumbilo. Ndawuli? Sivafuluche valonje kuta henye nyeka muna lukwale? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Lechelelo manyi vanu veka vave vanvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu, kaha atse munu yo alihela litumbilo awu munu yunji hela, ndongwa tsila tso anhulika tsikumudita atsele kuta mwene ana ndongwa ntsibi na akuhigwa na chila cho anhulika, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />na fiho tsake tsa munumbula tsikugubulwa, nayo akufugama na kumusuka Mulungu kuno anlonga, “Kweli Mulungu alihamwe na henye.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumusuka Mulungu kota fyo yiganika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Nyee vang'olotsangu lelo tulonje chichi? Hala ho mungitang'ana hamwe kumufugamila Mulungu, yumwe imbe tsabuli, na yunji adahitse, na yunji alonje chila cho agubulwe na Mulungu, na yunji alonje kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, na yumwe adadafule chila cho anlonga yula yo anlonga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu. Ndongwa tseka tsiditwaje kwasawuli ya kuvakangatsa vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Manyi kuna munu yoyuve yo akulonga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu, yin'ganika valonje vanu vavili awu vadatu duve kwa kiyanuchila yumwe yumwe, na hagati ha vanu iwo yin'ganika yumwe adadafule cho chinlongwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Lechelelo manyi kuve kuduhu munu yo akuvetsa kudadafula cho chinlongwa, duve yula yo akulonga wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu akatukaje aleche kulonga hamukong'ano ugo, alonje na numbula yake mwene na Mulungu vake. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Vanu wo vanya chifunje cha kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu van'ganika vave vavili awu vadatu, na vanu vanji vatsihimaje ndongwa itso. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Manyi munu yoyuve ha mukong'ano ugo ankwendelela kulonga na yunji agubulilwe lulongwa kuhuma kwa Mulungu, duve yula yo avije anlonga akatukaje. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Kwasawuli nyeka mufuluche muvikule wujumbe wa Mulungu, mulongaje munu yumwe yumwe, ili chila munu avetse kidahitsa na kukangatswa numbula yake. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Chifunje cha kuvikula wujumbe wa Mulungu chin'ganika chimililwe na mwene munya chifunje icho, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />kwakuva Mulungu siyo Mulungu va chitika ndaya, ila va wusichimafu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kota fyoyili mu makong'ano geka ga vanu va Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />na kota fyoyili ntsovelo kwa vanu veka wo vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, kuta vadala veka vakatukaje myee mu mikong'ano ja vanu vanya litumbilo. Kwakuva valihela luhusa ya kulonga ila vavaje vadeche kota fyo ganlonga malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Manyi van'gana kuwutsa chinu chochive, vakavawutse valume vawo kukaye. Kwasawuli yinkuva nyoni kwa mudala kulonga halutalo ha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Mbe, muntijila Ndongwa tsa Mulungu tsihumye kwenyu? Awu kuta tsatsitse kwajili ya henye ng'ani? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Manyi hana munu yoyuve anhotsa kuta mwene yo mutantsi va Mulungu awu kuta ana chifunje cha Muhe va Mulungu, duve atselaje kuta finu fino fyo ntsinguvandichila henye iyo yo amuli ya Mutwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Lechelelo manyi munu akutsibedala ndongwa tsino, duve na henye mumubedalaje. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ihyo lelo, vang'olotsangu, mun'ganika kiwiniwa kuvikula Ndongwa tsa Mulungu, lechelelo mulekaje kumulemetsa munu yoyuve kulonga kwa wulontsi wa kuhuma kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ihyo lelo chila chinu chiditwaje kwa hesima na kota fyo yin'ganika kuditwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kutsilipuka kwa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Lelo vang'olotsangu, ntsin'gana ntsiviwuse yila Ndongwa Nofu yo ntsavavikulye, nanye mukayanuche na kwa yiyo mwimile kwa wukangatso. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Kwa Ndongwa yino Nofu ya Mulungu yo ntsavavikulye munkuluswa, manyi mukibatilitsa finofu. Tebe na ihyo, mukuva mwitumbye chinu chinji.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Heni ntsavakabitse chinu chikomi chila cho ntsanuche, kuta Chilisito afweye kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsetu ntsibi, kota fyo ganlonga Mandiko ga Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />kuta atsisilwe na akatsilipukaje siku ya kadatu, kota fyo ganlonga mu Mandiko ga Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />nayo akamuhumilaje Chefwa, na kahi akavahumilaje vala vatumi kumi na vavili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Kaha akavahumilaje hohamwe vala vang'olotsetu tsaidi ya miya tanu, hagati ha iwo vamwe vang'acha wumi mbaka sambi, lechelelo vamwinga mwanga vafweye. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Hambele akamuhumilaje Yakobo, na kahi akavahumilaje vatumi veka.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Hoavaga kuvahumila veka, akanyumilaje na heni, yo ntsavaga kota munu yo aleliche luvala lo silwaganikaga. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kwakuva heni yo ntsili mudodo kulutila vatumi veka, na singanikije kuchemwa mutumi, kwa hila fyo ntsavakodite vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Lechelelo kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu mbeye kota fyontsili, na wuwuya wake kwa heni siwuveye wa bule hela. Heni ndisile katsi kulutila vatumi veka, sintsadisile ihyo kwa wuvetso wangu hela, ila kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu wo wunkola katsi hamwe na heni. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Lechelelo nayivaje ihyo, manyi ntsive heni awu vatumi vanji, tunguchivikula Ndongwa Nofu, hetwe tweka tunvikula chinu chimwe, na icho cho muchitumbye.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsilipuka kwetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Lelo manyi tuvikwe kuta Chilisito atsilipuche, yiveye ndawuli vanu vanji hagati henyu vanlonga kuta vanu wo vafweye sivakutsilipulwa? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Lechelelo manyi yive wukweli kuta kuduhu wutsilipuko, duve nambe Chilisito nayo si akatsilipuche, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />na manyi yive Chilisito si akatsilipuche, duve nambe mbikulo tsetu tsilihela mana yoyive na litumbilo lyenyu linkuva si chinu ndaya. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kulutila ifyo fyeka, tukakuva vadesi halutalo ha Mulungu kwa chila cho twahuliche na kulonga, kwasawuli twavaga tulontsile kuta Mulungu amutsilipwe Chilisito, lulongwa ulo lukakuva lwa wukweli manyi vanu wo vafweye sivatsilipulwaga. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Manyi yive kweli kuta vanu wo vafweye sivatsilipulwaga, duve nambe Chilisito siakatsilipuche. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Na kaha manyi Chilisito siakatsilipuche, duve litumbilo lyenu liveye lya bule hela, mung'acha mungikala mu ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Ihyo lelo, na vala veka wo vafweye kuno vamutumbye Chilisito vakuva vayatsile hela. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Manyi lihuvilo lyetu kwa Chilisito lili kwasawuli ya wumi wuno hela, hetwe tun'ganika kuwonelwa lusungu kulutila vanu veka va mu inyi. <verse eid="1CO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Lechelelo wukweli wuli hino, Chilisito atsilipuche, mwene yo mulongola va vala veka wo valongwe kuvasa mu chifo kota fyofili fibetwa filongola. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kwakuva kota hila chifo fyo chatsitse mu inyi kukolela kwa munu yumwe, nayo yo Adamu, ho hihyo na kutsilipuka kwa vanu kutsitse kukolela kwa munu yumwe, nayo yo Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Kota hila vanu veka fyo vankufwa kwasawuli ya kihatsa na Adamu, ho hihyo na vanu veka vakutsilipulwa kwa kihantsa na Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Lechelelo chila munu akutsilipulwa kwa luvala lwake! Chilisito yo mulongola kutsilipuka, hambele vakutsilipuka vala veka wo vanu vake hala ho akuva kutsa mwene. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Hambele wukufika wula wudugo, Chilisito akumukabitsa Dada Mulungu wuntsajila wake, hala Chilisito ho akuva anantsile chila wutavala na mamulaka na wuvetso wake. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kwakuva latsima Chilisito atavale mbaka hala ho akuva avasumile vatelani vake na kuvavika hasi ha magulu gake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Vatelani veka vakwanagwa na hawudugo chikwanangwa chifo. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga, “Mulungu afivisile finu fyeka hasi ha wutavala wake.” Lechelelo mandiko ho ganlonga kuta, “Finu fyeka fivisilwe hasi hake.” Yinlajila kuta Mulungu yo afivisile finu fyeka hasi ya Chilisto, na Mulungu si afuluche ave yumwe va finu ifyo, kwasawuli mwene yo afivisile finu ifyo fyeka mu mamulaka ga Chilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Lechelelo finu fyeka ho fikuvikwa mu wutavala wa Chilisito, ho iho nayo Mwana ho akivika hasi ha wutavala wa Mulungu yo avisile fyeka hasi ha wutavala wake, ili Mulungu afitavale finu fyeka.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Lelo manyi kuduhu wutsilipuko, vanu vala wo vam'batitswa kwajili ya vanu wo vafweye vangihuvila kupata chinu chachi? Manyi vanu wo vafweye sinambe vatsilipulwe, kuna mana yachi kubatitswa kwasawuli ya vanu wo vafweye? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Na hetwe natwe, kwasawuli yachi tungiyingitsa mu ng'oko chila luvala? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Nyee vang'olotsangu chifo chili halutalo hangu chila siku! Ntsingidutsa kwasawuli ya henye fyo mwihantsitse na Chilisito Yesu Mutwa vetu, icho chochin'ndita ndonje lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Manyi chila cho ntsin'gana chika chive kota fyo vahotsaga vanu va mu inyi, kula kisumana kwangu na vanu vabi wo vavaga kota minyama mibi hano ha Efweso, kuna mana yachi? Manyi wo vafweye sinambe vatsilipuche ntsika kulonga, “Chiba tulye na kung'wa, kwakuva mitondo tukufwa.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Mulekaje kudeteletswa! “Kihantsa na vanu vabi, kwanangaga tabiya nofu.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Nyee, mulamuche! Mwikalaje finofu! Mulekaje kudita ndongwa ntsibi. Ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa itso ili ntsivadite muwone nyoni kwasawuli vanu vamwinga hagati henyu sinambevamutsele Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvili gwa kutsilipuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Lechelelo munu afuluche aputse, “Vanu wovafweye vakutsilipulwa chinya ndawuli? Kaha vakuva na muvili gwa chinya ndawuli?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Itso mbutso tsa chipuva! Manyi uyale nyadikwa mu lilongo, na manyi nyadikwa iyo yileche kugaluka hila fyoyili, nyadikwa iyo siyifuluche yote. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Chila cho mun'yala chivaga nyadikwa hela, yifuluche yive nyadikwa ya mibangayeye awu ya chinu chinji, si mun'yala lila lisina lyo likota hambele. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Lechelelo Mulungu ayipelaga muvili iyo nyadikwa kota fyo an'gana mwene. Chila nyadikwa yipataga muvili gwake gwa wiyeka.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Mivili ja fiwumbe fyeka sijili sava ndaya. Mivili ja vanu jihwanaga, na ja minyama najo jihwanaga, na hihilaga kwa mideje, na ja somba najo.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Hihilaga kojili mivili ja kilanga kwa Mulungu na mivili ja muinyi. Wunofu wa mivili ja kilanga kwa Mulungu wuli finji, na wunofu wa mivili ja mu inyi nawo wuli finji. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Litsuva lina wunofu wake, na mwetsi nago guna wunofu wake, na nyenyetsi natso sitsihwanaga wunofu wake.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Hohihyo fyo yikuva hala vanu wo vafweye ho vakutsilipulwa. Muvili gutsikwaga na kuwola, lechelelo ho gukuva gun'tsilipulwa gunkuva na wumi. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Hala muvili ho gutsikwaga guvaga mutenyanjifu, ila gukutsilipulwa kwa wumelemo, gun'tsikwa kwa wutenyanjifu, ila gutsilipulwaga guna wuvetso. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Hogun'tsikwa gunkuva muvili gwa kawaida hela, hala ho gun'tsilipulwa gunkuva muvili gwa chimuhe. Ihyo kuna muvili gwa kawayida na kaha kukuva na muvili gwa chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Kwakuva Mandiko ganlonga, “Munu va kwantsa yo Adamu, avaga awumbitwe na wumi mugati mwake,” lechelelo Adamu va wudugo yo Muhe yo avapelaga vanu wumi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Lechelelo muvili gogunlongola siyo gula gwa chimuhe, ila gula muvili gwa kawayida, hambele gula muvili gwa chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Munu mulongola yo Adamu awumbitwe mu inyi na ahumye mu lilongo, munu va kavili ahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Vanu veka wo vali mu inyi vanakota uyo munu yo awumbitwe kwa lilongo, ila vala veka va kilanga kwa Mulungu vanakota yula yo ahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Sambi twihwanile na munu yula va mu inyi, hambele tukihwana na yula munu yo ahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Lelo vang'olotsangu, ntsinlonga kuta chila cho chidisilwe kwa muvili na danda si chifuluche chihantse mu wuntsajila wa Mulungu, na chila chinya kwananjika sichifuluche chikale hihyo bila kwananjika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Muhulikitse ntsivalonjele henye chila Mulungu cho ang'ali kuvalonjela vanu vake. Hetwe tweka situkufwa, ila tweka tukugalulwa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />simusika kota kufutitsa miho, likuhulikwa litsi lya palapanda ya wudugo, nawo vanu wo vafweye vakutsilipulwa na mivili jo sijifuluche jifwe kanji, natwe tweka tukugalulwa na kuva mivili josinambe jifwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Kwakuva latsima chila chinya kwananjika chifwale hali yosi nambe yananjiche, na muvili gunya kufwa gufwale hali yo sinambe yifwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ihyo muvili guno gunya kwananjika hala ho gukugalulwa na kuva sinambegufwe, na chila chinya kufwa chikugalulwa ili chileche kufwa, iho ho lukukwila lula lulongwa lo lwandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Chifo chanantsilwe, na wusumi wutsitse!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Bee, chifo kulikwiya kusuma kwako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Bee chifo kulikwiya kutama kwako?<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Chifo chipataga wuvetso wa kutetsa kwasawuli ya ndongwa ntsibi, nayo ndongwa ntsibi yipataga wuvetso kuhuma ku malajitso ga Mulungu go amupelye Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Lechelelo ahongetswaje Mulungu yo angutupela wusumi kukolela kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Ihyo vang'olotsangu wo ntsinguvagana, mwimaje kwa wukangatso. Mwendelelaje kukola katsi ya Mutwa bila kufulugala, kuno mutselaje kuta katsi yo munkola mu wutantsi wa Mutwa siyikuyaga hihi hela.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuvasojela vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Lelo, kwasawuli ya gula muchango gwa vanu va Mulungu wo vali ku Yelusalemu. Muditaje kota fyo ntsavalajitse vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vali ku Galatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Chila Jumapili chila munu abagulaje chiyasi cha magobole, kota chipato chake fyochili, ili hala honguvantsitsitse kuleche kuva na wulatsima wa kusoga michango. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Hala honguva ntsitsitse, nguvatuma vala wo mukuvahagula kuhuma hagati henyu, ili vasindiche baluva na fifunje fyenyu uko ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Manyi yikuva finofu na heni mbite, duve tukubitasa hamwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipanjo ja Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Ngutsa kwenyu hala ho nguva njendye ku Machedoniya, kwakuva ntsin'gana kuvajendela vanu va ku Machedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Fuluche ntsikale na henye kwa luvala lutunga, awu fuluche ntsikale na henye mu chipindi cheka cha ng'ala, ili munanje kwendelela na lujendo lwangu kokuve ko ngugana kubita. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Sinambengane ntsitse ntsivalole kuno ntsili wimawima hela. Manyi Mutwa agane, ntsingihuvila kuta ngikala hamwe na henye kwa siku ntsolofu.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Lechelelo ngikala ihano ha Efweso mbaka siku ya Pendekosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Ntsin'wona Mulungu amelye nyafwasi ya kukola katsi yangu yino ngomi, na yivaje kuno ku Efweso kuna vatelani wolofu wo valitebe na heni.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Manyi Timoseyo atse kwa henye, mumulibulitsaje na kikala nayo finofu ili aleche kuva na wususutafu, kwasawuli ankola katsi ya Mutwa, kota fyo ntsinkola heni. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Ihyo lelo halekaje kuva na munu yoyuve yo akumubedala, lechelelo mumutangaje endelele na lujendo lwake kwa wusichimafu ili avetse kupiluka kwa heni, kwakuva heni hamwe na vang'olotsetu tungumutsindila.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Lelo kwajili ya mung'olotsetu Apolo, ntsimugongolitse ndalahela ili atse kwenyu hamwe na ivo vanya litumbilo vanji. Lechelelo mwene sinambeagane kutsa sambi, ila akutsa hala ho akuva apatite nyafwasi.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa kusindilitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ihyo lelo mwikalaje kwa wukangatso mu litumbilo, mwikangatsaje na muvaje na wuvetso. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Chila chinu cho mun'dita muditaje kwa kigana.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Henye mun'tsela kuta vanu va mu kaye ya Sitefwana iwo wo vavaga vanu valongola kwanuchila litumbilo lya Chilisito ku muji gwa Akaya, nawo vitawe kuvatanga vanu va Mulungu. Vang'olotsangu ntsinguvagongola, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />na henye muvigaje filongotsi kota ivo, mukolaje katsi hamwe nawo, na muvahesimilaje vanu veka wo vankola katsi hame nawo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Heni ntsinhechelela ndalahela kwa kufika kwa Sitefwana, na Fotunatusi na Akayiko, kwasawuli vadinile yila nyafwasi yenyu hala henye ho mwavaga mulihaduhu, <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />vene vayipotsitse numbula yangu, kota fyo vapotsitse numbula tsenyu. Ihyo lelo mun'ganika kuvahesimila ndalahela vanu wo vanakota iva.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Vanu veka vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vali ku Asiya vanguvasamusani. Achila na Pilisila hamwe na vanu veka va Mulungu wo vitang'anaga mu kaye yawo vanguvasamusa ndalahela kwa hila fyo mwihantsitse na Mutwa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Vang'olotsetu veka wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo valihano vanguvasamusani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Mwisamusaje kwa kinonela kwa kulajila kuta muna wusichimafu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Heni Pawulo, tsinguvandichila samuso tsino kwa liwoko lyangu ntsimwene.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Munu yoyuve yo sinambe amugane Mutwa akotokaje! MALANASA chinya kutijila Mutwa vetu, utse!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Ntsingumusuka Mutwa Yesu endelele kuvaditila wuwuya.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ntsinguvagana henye nyeka wo mwihantsitse na Mutwa Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>